      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A 28-weeks gestation pregnant patient with chronic pacreatitis and severe abdominal pain leading to impaired nutrition is presented. After detailed consideration of the case, fluoroscopic-guided celiac plexus neurolysis was performed. The block was performed using the transaortic approach as it reduces radiation exposure."
      },
